        1512,
        1189
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. **Office for Homeless Facilities and Service Development.** There\nis hereby established in the Office of the Mayor the Office for Homeless Facilities and\nService Development which shall be headed by a Director who shall be appointed by and\nserve at the pleasure of the Mayor. The Office shall report to and be directly accountable\nto the Deputy Mayor for Health and Human Services.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2662,
          "min": -1.3606
