    {
      "bbox": [
        210,
        1230,
        1512,
        2045
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2. **Responsibilities of the Office.** Until such time as the new agency\nis created, the Office shall, in consultation with the Human Resources Administration\n(HRA), the Department of Housing Preservation and Development and other agencies\ninvolved in the provision of services for homeless families and individuals, and consistent\nwith law, (1) oversee and direct on behalf of the Mayor the actions necessary for the\nestablishment of a new City agency to manage the delivery of services to homeless families\nand individuals, (2) participate in the planning and implementation of the redesigning and\nrestructuring of the current system for the provision of services and facilities for homeless\nfamilies and individuals, (3) make recommendations to HRA concerning the planning and\ndevelopment of and contracting for services and facilities for homeless families and\nindividuals, and (4) encourage the participation of and receive proposals from the public and",
